    effective May 7, 2025) and <a href="https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title38/Chapter11/38-11-S107.html" rel="noopener">§38-11-107</a> and <a href="https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title38/Chapter11/38-11-S204.html" rel="noopener">§38-11-204</a>, read on le.utah.gov; DOPL rule R156-55a (effective August 7, 2026). This page is general information, not legal advice.
  </p>
